{
  "_comment": "One browser per case: its Accept-Language header and the navigator.languages list the same browser reports. 'czech' is whether it should get the Czech pages. Vitest holds detectLocale (src/store/useLocaleStore.ts) to it; the 'frontend security headers' CI job holds nginx's $lang_prefers_cs map (nginx.conf) to it.",
